data: {"id": "ff43a17d76264713-thinking-parallel_evidence-1854", "run_id": "ff43a17d76264713", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 已采集事实\n\n1.  **当前状态确认（支持 CreateContainerConfigError）**\n    *   **Prometheus Metrics**：`kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` 值为 1，reason 明确标记为 `CreateContainerConfigError`；`kube_pod_status_phase` 为 Pending，`restarts_total` 为 0（从未启动成功）。\n    *   **Kubernetes Describe**：Pod 状态为 Pending，容器 `app` 处于 Waiting 状态，Reason 为 `CreateContainerConfigError`。Events 显示 kubelet 报出重复错误。\n\n2.  **根因定位（Secret Key 缺失）**\n    *   **Events/Message**：kubelet 明确指出 `Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret ai", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789053470125, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

event: node_complete
data: {"id": "ff43a17d76264713-node_complete-parallel_evidence", "run_id": "ff43a17d76264713", "seq": 1855, "ts_ms": 1789053476119, "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "并发证据采集", "duration_seconds": 28.627, "state_snapshot": {"contract_version": "aiops.parallel-evidence-output.v2", "group_count": 1, "expected_group_count": 1, "terminal_group_count": 1, "join_complete": true, "diagnosed_count": 1, "inconclusive_count": 0, "error_count": 0, "errors": [], "groups": [{"group_id": "g1", "presentation_index": 0, "entities": [{"kind": "Pod", "namespace": "aiops-case-04", "name": "workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9"}], "diagnostic_status": "diagnosed", "artifact_ref": {"path": "/tmp/aiops/reports/context_archives/ff43a17d76264713-g1/lane_artifacts/g1/artifact.json", "sha256": "7d9bd70ab49b09182171691f8705d61cbfb45a50b9152712767bb79d84bff37f", "bytes": 2452}, "snapshot_sha256": "9819477f381d3872c4c4ae284207cba266eb25621cf54a5805235adf94945c2a"}]}, "handoff_summary": ""}

