data: {"id": "ff43a17d76264713-final", "run_id": "ff43a17d76264713", "seq": 1859, "ts_ms": 1789053484114, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9` | CreateContainerConfigError | CreateContainerConfigError |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9` 状态为 `Pending`，且 `pod.phase` 确认处于等待态 | 确认异常实体的最终调度停滞状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning Failed`: \"Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\" | 直接证明 kubelet 因配置项缺失而中止容器创建 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: `CreateContainerConfigError` | 对应异常现象，定位至容器配置校验失败阶段 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_message`: \"couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input\" | 精确指明缺失的配置资源及键名 |\n| 5 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"CreateContainerConfigError\"} = 1` | 独立验证该 Pod 的容器处于配置错误等待状态 |\n\n证据说明：Kubernetes 的 Event 记录和状态字段（#2, #3, #4）直接给出了缺失键的明确报错原因，这与 Prometheus 指标中记录的特定等待原因（#5）相互印证。Pod 的 Pending 状态（#1）是该配置错误导致的直接系统表现，排除了调度或网络等其他维度的故障。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nSecret aiops-case-04/workload-input 缺失 key unavailable-key → kubelet 在容器创建前校验配置失败 → Pod 停滞于 Pending 状态，容器报错 CreateContainerConfigError → 用户不可见应用日志或网络流量\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因是 Pod 容器定义中引用的 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在必需的键 `unavailable-key`（证据 #2, #3, #4）。\n\n该缺失导致 kubelet 在创建容器阶段无法完成配置注入，触发 `CreateContainerConfigError`。由于容器从未成功启动，系统未能产生应用日志或 Trace 数据（Logging/Tracing 维度为空），所有诊断证据均来源于 Kubernetes 状态与事件记录。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.2m\n├─ 问题定位: 35.8s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 28.6s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9: 28.6s (Evidence 22.7s, RCA 5.9s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 8.0s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 72.446, "metrics": {"run_id": "ff43a17d76264713", "mttr": {"value": "1.2m", "seconds": 72.45230507850647, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 72452.30507850647, "llm_calls": 11, "llm_duration_ms": 69603.12795639038, "tool_calls": 9, "executed_tool_calls": 8, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 1, "successful_tool_calls": 9, "failed_tool_calls": 0, "tool_duration_ms": 6564.183235168457, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 2552.175760269165}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 35820.84393501282, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms":